<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/alternative> "NORMA Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Leyva-Sánchez, S. et al. (2026). NORMA-O: The NORMA Ontology for Legal Norm Annotations (Version 1.0) [Ontology]. https://w3id.org/norma-ontology/1.0"@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:genid1 .
_:genid1 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "NORMA project contributors" .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
