<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> _:genid2 .
_:genid2 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Sheyla Leyva-Sánchez" .
_:genid2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ontology for representing machine-readable legal norm annotations derived from BPMN workflow models in the NORMA pipeline. The ontology models regulative norms (obligations, prohibitions, permissions, and recommendations) and constitutive rules expressing legal responsibilities, along with legal conditions, legal sources, legal agents, legal objects, provenance metadata and lifecycle status. It aligns with PROV-O (provenance), ELI (legal resources), and FOAF (agents and project metadata). Legal conditions are connected to normative content via a W3C n-ary relation pattern (TriggerEvent) that associates each condition outcome with the specific normative content it activates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-04-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language> <http://id.loc.gov/vocabulary/iso639-1/en> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-04-25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> _:genid3 .
_:genid3 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "NORMA project" .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Organization> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://github.com/sheyls/norma-semantic-toolkit> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "NORMA-O: The NORMA Ontology for Legal Norm Annotations"@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/doi> "10.5281/zenodo.19765302" .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status> "Published"@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "norma" .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#" .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Publication-quality ontology aligned to the NORMA annotation model and BPMN legal compliance workflow."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NORMA ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://www.w3.org/TR/swbp-n-aryRelations/> .
