# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#TriggerEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#NormativeContent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a trigger event to the normative content it activates. Declared functional because each trigger event activates exactly one normative content item. Declared as a subproperty of rdf:value to mark the activated norm as the main value of the reified n-ary relation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#activatesNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "activates norm"@en .
