<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#generatedNormativeContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#NormativeContent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#generatedNormativeContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an annotation activity to normative content that it generated."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#generatedNormativeContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
