<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasExtractionMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has extraction method"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#RegulativeNorm> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#LegalAction> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a regulative norm to the legal action it regulates. The NORMA pipeline may instead use the literal shortcut `norma:actionText`; both forms are permitted."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has legal action"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#RegulativeNorm> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#LegalAgent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a regulative norm to its norm-bearing legal agent (the subject obliged, prohibited, permitted, or recommended)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has legal agent"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalObject
