<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalObject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a regulative norm to the legal object of the action it regulates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalObject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalObject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has legal object"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#isLegalSourceOf> .
