<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#LegalSource> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links normative content to the legal source (work-level resource) from which it is extracted."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasLegalSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has legal source"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#isNormStatusOf> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#NormativeContent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#NormStatus> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates a normative content item with exactly one lifecycle status."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasNormStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has norm status"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#isOutcomeOfTriggerEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#TriggerEvent> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#ConditionOutcome> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a trigger event to the condition outcome that characterises it, for example the true branch, false branch, or another controlled outcome. Declared functional because each trigger event has exactly one outcome."@en .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/norma-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has outcome"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#hasReviewStatus
