<https://w3id.org/norma-ontology#triggersNorm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Shortcut: links a legal condition to a normative content item whenever the condition has a trigger event that activates that norm. Implemented as the OWL 2 property chain hasTrigger ∘ activatesNorm. The outcome branch is not recoverable from this shortcut alone; clients that need the true, false, or other branch outcome must traverse the reified TriggerEvent node."@en .
